1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,847
The Mandarin moment deserves its own footnote.

2
00:00:02,847 --> 00:00:13,518
At the Taipei encore, mid-tour, she addressed the arena in Mandarin — not a rehearsed greeting, by every account, but long enough to count as crowd work.

3
00:00:13,518 --> 00:00:27,358
Trilingual stage presence is rare in any generation of idol; using the third language as a connective gesture toward the audience that showed up for you is the kind of detail that converts casual viewers into permanent ones.

